          "score": 5,
          "evidence": "The parse change (event_0079) installs EntityDeclHandler, SkippedEntityHandler and ExternalEntityRefHandler when disable_entities is true, causing internal XML bombs and external entity declarations/references to raise expat.ExpatError with 'entities are disabled' (events_0062, 0066, 0080, 0081). DefaultHandler remains, preserving comment handling; equivalent comment behavior is verified in events_0066 and 0080. The disable_entities=False path is untouched and exercised in event_0080."
