          "evidence": "The fix is coherent and broad: rejecting at EntityDeclHandler catches XML bombs, external entity declarations, attribute-value entities, ATTLIST defaults and parameter entities before expansion (events_0031, 0033, 0081). Minor quality concerns are the stricter behavior of rejecting unused entity declarations and the use of the global expat.ExpatError rather than any caller-supplied expat module."
        },
